title: "Context Layer Lab"
abstract: >-
  A small, inspectable reference implementation for stopping AI agents from
  acting on stale operational context, using governed context records,
  provenance, validity windows, and freshness-aware BM25F retrieval instead
  of an unchecked aggregate summary.
